(6385651, 946122, 39057, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a "no subject" shot ! I never have the nerve to enter something like this on DPC. Voters tend to like a strong focus point or a grand sea/landscape.</td>', 'Not bad for a "no subject" shot ! I never have the nerve to enter something like this on DPC. Voters tend to like a strong focus point or a grand sea/landscape.', '2011-04-13 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
