(6385656, 945803, 39057, '<td valign="top">There''s a guy on DPC who used to challenge all of these types of shots and put the comment nice "zoo shot" as a zinger at the photographer. However, to me it doesn''t matter where the photo was taken....good focus and color.</td>', 'There''s a guy on DPC who used to challenge all of these types of shots and put the comment nice "zoo shot" as a zinger at the photographer. However, to me it doesn''t matter where the photo was taken....good focus and color.', '2011-04-13 23:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
