(6385660, 945959, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the color. Good to see a warm color that is NOT bright yellow !</td>', 'Nice job on the color. Good to see a warm color that is NOT bright yellow !', '2011-04-13 23:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385663, 946052, 39057, '<td valign="top">At first glance I was about to score a 5...however, after a few seconds I realized how good this is. The effect of the bending light is very BIG ! The bubbles are nice too. You did a good job at capturing the entire glass without blowing it out. Looks like it may be natural light from a high window.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'At first glance I was about to score a 5...however, after a few seconds I realized how good this is. The effect of the bending light is very BIG ! The bubbles are nice too. You did a good job at capturing the entire glass without blowing it out. Looks like it may be natural light from a high window. 8', '2011-04-13 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6385665, 945443, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line from stump to sol. Also...it almost looks like someone laying on the beach too !</td>', 'Nice leading line from stump to sol. Also...it almost looks like someone laying on the beach too !', '2011-04-13 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
