(6388422, 946122, 113156, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, i''m not sure if the colors are warm enough for this to do well, but i think its great.</td>', 'Very good photo, i''m not sure if the colors are warm enough for this to do well, but i think its great.', '2011-04-17 08:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388444, 946132, 113156, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good POV and i like the colors</td>', 'Very nice, good POV and i like the colors', '2011-04-17 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388562, 945855, 131377, '<td valign="top">Love this. :)</td>', 'Love this. :)', '2011-04-17 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388565, 945940, 131377, '<td valign="top">I always have a hard time getting good photos in this amount of light. Well done. :)</td>', 'I always have a hard time getting good photos in this amount of light. Well done. :)', '2011-04-17 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388566, 945386, 131377, '<td valign="top">I have never seen an ant do that before.</td>', 'I have never seen an ant do that before.', '2011-04-17 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388570, 945924, 131377, '<td valign="top">I''m going to give you two totally different comments, one as a photo person and one as a horse person. :)<br/> <br/>I LOVE the color scheme in this photo. I don''t think it would have worked out as well if you hadn''t been on a sorrel horse. Everything is totally warm and peaceful, and I love your focus. Love the light.<br/> <br/>I love how your horse is relaxed, but attentive, and clearly listening to you; alert to your surroundings, but not flinging the head all over the place.<br/> <br/>Awesome photo.</td>', 'I''m going to give you two totally different comments, one as a photo person and one as a horse person. :) I LOVE the color scheme in this photo. I don''t think it would have worked out as well if you hadn''t been on a sorrel horse. Everything is totally warm and peaceful, and I love your focus. Love the light. I love how your horse is relaxed, but attentive, and clearly listening to you; alert to your surroundings, but not flinging the head all over the place. Awesome photo.', '2011-04-17 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388574, 945408, 131377, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better if it weren''t so dark around the bottom, but I love the glare on the top.</td>', 'I''d like it better if it weren''t so dark around the bottom, but I love the glare on the top.', '2011-04-17 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388575, 945371, 131377, '<td valign="top">Wow! O.O</td>', 'Wow! O.O', '2011-04-17 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388578, 945281, 131377, '<td valign="top">I really like this alot.</td>', 'I really like this alot.', '2011-04-17 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388579, 945218, 131377, '<td valign="top">He looks like he was moving his head? If it had been totally still, this would have been absolutely perfect. It''s still awesome.</td>', 'He looks like he was moving his head? If it had been totally still, this would have been absolutely perfect. It''s still awesome.', '2011-04-17 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388581, 946130, 131377, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to find out exactly what that thing is. Whatever it is, it made a good picture.</td>', 'I''m curious to find out exactly what that thing is. Whatever it is, it made a good picture.', '2011-04-17 14:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388582, 945304, 131377, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea, but maybe not executed as well as it could have been. If it were focused alot sharper, I might have given it a much better vote. Great idea though.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea, but maybe not executed as well as it could have been. If it were focused alot sharper, I might have given it a much better vote. Great idea though.', '2011-04-17 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
