(6390442, 945892, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but you''re gonna get hammered for the desaturated, almost-sepia look of it. Gotta oversaturate to win this one. I''m in a similar position with mine, so let''s stick together :-) 9 from me, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but you''re gonna get hammered for the desaturated, almost-sepia look of it. Gotta oversaturate to win this one. I''m in a similar position with mine, so let''s stick together :-) 9 from me, I like it a lot.', '2011-04-19 18:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
