(6390444, 946122, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. There''s something about it that really sings to me, though I can''t put my finger on the song offhand :-) Warm greens, even a warm blue, don''t let anyone argue otherwise.</td>', 'This is terrific. There''s something about it that really sings to me, though I can''t put my finger on the song offhand :-) Warm greens, even a warm blue, don''t let anyone argue otherwise.', '2011-04-19 18:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
