(6391669, 945785, 130777, '<td valign="top">This one was part of a larger shoot. There''s a more abstract shot in my portfolio and I just posted a more "clinical" image in my workshop. These were filled with diesel fuel in the 1930''s to early 1960''s and lit to lay down a blanket of smoke to retain heat in citrus orchards during a freeze. Very dirty and unhealthy practice that is not missed in Southern California!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_mgr.php?collection_id=2" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_mgr.php?collection_id=2</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-20 19:22:40.</i></td>', 'This one was part of a larger shoot. There''s a more abstract shot in my portfolio and I just posted a more "clinical" image in my workshop. These were filled with diesel fuel in the 1930''s to early 1960''s and lit to lay down a blanket of smoke to retain heat in citrus orchards during a freeze. Very dirty and unhealthy practice that is not missed in Southern California! //www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_mgr.php?collection_id=2', '2011-04-20 20:21:04.000000', '2011-04-20 20:22:40.000000', 0),
